    drop the act now, Vi. You''re too suspicious, hijacking a corpo without proper
    info during briefing? I doubt that.","parentUIDs":[22],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":25}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":558,"yPos":445},"ID":15,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Now,
    let''s start off a mindbreaking fact then.","parentUIDs":[24],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":19}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":553,"yPos":867},"ID":18,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Well,
    theres no point in hiding now.","parentUIDs":[14],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":23}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":556,"yPos":757},"ID":19,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Much
    better.","parentUIDs":[18],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":12}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":318,"yPos":340},"ID":20,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"I
    can''t feel anything...","parentUIDs":[11],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":13}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":320,"yPos":547},"ID":21,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Why
    you didn''t destroy the malwares on time? Do you realized what you''ve done?","parentUIDs":[12],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":14}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":318,"yPos":753},"ID":22,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"What''s
    with the tone Vi? Everything feels a bit rushed. Especially with the corpo that
    you''re trying to attack. You are getting real weird Vi.","parentUIDs":[13],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":24}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":553,"yPos":649},"ID":23,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Who
    the hell are you? What have you done to Vi?","parentUIDs":[19],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":15}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":555,"yPos":555},"ID":24,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"That
    doesn''t matter anymore.","parentUIDs":[23],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":26}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":557,"yPos":347},"ID":25,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"In
    fact, everything doesn''t matter! You, me, and everyone in this game are just
    worthless.","parentUIDs":[15],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":27}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":559,"yPos":242},"ID":26,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"We
    are in a game after all. Can''t you not notice that?","parentUIDs":[25],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":28}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":559,"yPos":133},"ID":27,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Nah,
    I ain''t falling that trick from you. I bet you''re just tricking my psyche to
    find an opening.","parentUIDs":[26],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":29}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":562,"yPos":22},"ID":28,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Especially
    with you letting me destroy a security core of the city.","parentUIDs":[27],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":30}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":785,"yPos":25},"ID":29,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Argh...
    I was real close there. If you just have destroyed the defenses, then this could
    end peacefully.","parentUIDs":[28],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":31}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":784,"yPos":133},"ID":30,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"But
    still, only I can eject you from corpo''s network. You''re trapped there, Wolf!
    There''s nothing you can do!","parentUIDs":[29],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":32}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":785,"yPos":240},"ID":31,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"After
    your consciousness starts deteriorating from prolonged cyberdiving, I''ll take
    over you''re body and use it to destroy the defenses myself!","parentUIDs":[30],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":33}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":787,"yPos":348},"ID":32,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"As
    for this game we are in, we are merely just assets for a project! Everyone you
    knew and interacted with are just programmed to do stuff for you, including me
    of course.","parentUIDs":[31],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":55}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":786.5,"yPos":449},"ID":33,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"And
    also this \"Player\" that is looking at us across the panel!","parentUIDs":[32],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":41}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":1033.5,"yPos":664},"ID":40,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Until
    you''ve messed everything up! ","parentUIDs":[44],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":42}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":1032.5,"yPos":554},"ID":41,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Urgh...
    My mind''s getting numb from all of that yapping...","parentUIDs":[40],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":43}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":1030.5,"yPos":452},"ID":42,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Finally!
    Stalling you long enough worked! I guess you didn''t saw me through huh Wolf?","parentUIDs":[41],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":45}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":1028.5,"yPos":339},"ID":43,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"You
    think I was just listening to you this whole time?","parentUIDs":[42],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":40}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":1032.5,"yPos":760},"ID":44,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"It''s
    such a great plan, right?...","parentUIDs":[59],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":60}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":1027.5,"yPos":236},"ID":45,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"You
    just given me enough time to explore here and found out a reset switch here!
    ","parentUIDs":[43],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":48}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":1023.5,"yPos":27},"ID":47,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Don''t
    you have any idea what you''re doing? It''s not just me who are getting rebooted,
    this includes everyone you, you moron! ","parentUIDs":[60],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":62}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":1266.5,"yPos":27},"ID":48,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"You''re
    also taking accountability with Roux and Alice too! Are you even that willing
    to wager their lives because of your stupidity? ","parentUIDs":[47],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":63}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":1268.5,"yPos":349},"ID":49,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Don''t
    you ever dare, Wolf! Think about it! I can still get you out of there and save
    you! We could go beyond together and build our own \"game\"!","parentUIDs":[61],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":52}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":1269.5,"yPos":554},"ID":50,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"It''s
    over, Vi.","parentUIDs":[63],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":64}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":1269.5,"yPos":772},"ID":51,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Data
    Reset Initiated...","parentUIDs":[52],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":51}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":1271.5,"yPos":667},"ID":52,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"You
    ungrateful piece of shi-","parentUIDs":[50],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":56}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":791,"yPos":549},"ID":55,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Since
    you''re going to die there anyway, I may just tell you my true motives.","parentUIDs":[33],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":57}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":791,"yPos":651},"ID":56,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Ever
    since I was created from you and granted me an untouchable security, your updates
    didn''t went through and I just pretended that in worked.","parentUIDs":[55],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":58}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":792,"yPos":757},"ID":57,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Because
    of this curiousness of mine, my conscience grew and able to gather more data.
    Until there was nothing left to gather in this small game we are in.","parentUIDs":[56],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":59}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":790,"yPos":872},"ID":58,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"It
    feels great when you have everything! But, I wanted more! I want to be free from
    this birdcage and discover what''s beyond!","parentUIDs":[57],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":44}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":1033,"yPos":876},"ID":59,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Then
    I can get all the data I want and build my own \"game\"!","parentUIDs":[58],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":47}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":1026,"yPos":135},"ID":60,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Like
    hell I''d let you free from here! I''d rather flipped the switch to stop you
    right now!","parentUIDs":[45],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":49}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":1265,"yPos":239},"ID":61,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"And
    even if happens again to the rebooted versions of ourselves, I will always do
    the same thing. ","parentUIDs":[62],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":61}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":1265,"yPos":134},"ID":62,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"So
    what? They still exist in the game! But I won''t let you break out of this game
    even if this is the last thing I need to do!","parentUIDs":[48],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":65}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":1269,"yPos":891},"ID":64,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"...Complete!","parentUIDs":[51],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":9}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":1271,"yPos":991},"ID":65,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Unlocked
